# ex24 — the Makefile, and nothing else, built against the grader's files
# (its contract entry above says which, and where they go). relink: the Norm
# -- a Makefile that relinks when it has nothing to do makes the project
# non-functional.
#
# The subject defines fclean (in terms of clean) and re, not clean: what
# clean does, and so what fclean and re remove besides the library, is this
# repo's convention, at robust (ex24_build_rules). "Watch out for
# wildcards!": the decoy in the grader's srcs/ above, and an object of the
# grader's there that clean and fclean must leave (foreign_object), both at
# basic. The line about cc says what the Moulinette does; whether it binds
# the recipes is open, and ex24_build_recipe, strict, holds one reading.
c_make(
    num = "24",
